            score = 21,
            author = "slumber",
            text = "for those who are confused about how/when/where to get this quest:\n\n1. go to silverwind refuge and pick up https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25 (no prerequisite quests required).\n2. when killing https://www.wowhead.com/npc=12759, you should loot https://www.wowhead.com/item=16408 (i was unable to loot it before picking up the quest), which starts https://www.wowhead.com/quest=1918.\n3. turn in https://www.wowhead.com/quest=1918 and mastok will offer you https://www.wowhead.com/quest=824, requiring you to take the globe to je'neu inside blackfathom deeps.\n\nand you don't actually have to finish https://www.wowhead.com/quest=25 if the reward from https://www.wowhead.com/quest=824 is all you're after; you can just kill tideress for the quest-starting item, not finish killing all the other water elementals for the quest, and go turn in https://www.wowhead.com/quest=1918.",
