            text = "I recommend follow the road just to the right of the Splintertree Post. I ran into the runner mounted on a wolf roaming the main road. I found her just as I spotted a Saytre Village on my left. They are all lvl 27+ so be careful not too get too close. You'll have your hands full if you do.",
