    [13618] = {
        {
            id = 2463584,
            score = 6,
            author = "reelic",
            text = "as of Patch 7.1.5\nif you are only interested in https://www.wowhead.com/item=119326 no need to pick up, or do quests https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13615, https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13613, and https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13612 they are a waist of time for twinks, nontwinks xp is good so pick them up and do them your going right by them.\n\nDirect chain of quests to this one:\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=13618\npick this quest up from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=8582, go northwest to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33294 laying on a mound lifeless.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=13619\nPick up quest and bring it back to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=8582.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=13620\nwalk over to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33263 just over the other side of the walk path kneeling by three bodys {two orcs, one tauren} turn in https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13619.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=13621\ngo back to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33294 body coordinates 64.2/84.5 target https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33294 then click and use https://www.wowhead.com/item=45023. https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33304 will rise follow him to the lake shore. he reveals https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33302 who immediately jumps across lake and starts attacking you. {kill him} then back to ramparts to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=8582 next quest is picked up from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33284i]\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=13628\nGoto  talk to him so you can ride https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33374,  as of today you can be mounted or transformed to mount https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33374 no glitch on this quest, after talking to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=8582 goto https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33374 click on him, he takes you and drops you off at https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33421 sitting across the bonfire from you\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=13640\nSpeak to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33440, note you must follow them and wait for the https://www.wowhead.com/item=45069 to appear then collect it. You walk away, the https://www.wowhead.com/item=45069 will not stay or appear. WARNING https://www.wowhead.com/npc=3821 stealthed, https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33458, and https://www.wowhead.com/npc=3825 are patrolling the areas you need and will attack you or attack https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33440 who will run or disappear leaving you no https://www.wowhead.com/item=45069. 19 twinks should be able to kill easily prevent https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33440 from being attacked and you will get all the https://www.wowhead.com/item=45069 you need.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=13651\nKill and loot https://www.wowhead.com/npc=3928 for https://www.wowhead.com/item=45071.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=13653\nWARNING! must be dismounted and in true form don't be transformed you will not mount and the quest won't complete you must ride with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33421 to the ramparts, she keels over and dies. turn in quest at https://www.wowhead.com/npc=8582\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=13712\nautomatically dismounts you and puts you on https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33374, https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33421 jumps on the wrains and drives you in. run into splintertree post to where https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33421 is standing.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=13803\nMines in the rear of splintertree post, go in all the way to rear stay left at T. https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33760 stands under a make shift tent. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13805 is not part of the progression and doesn't have to be done to get https://www.wowhead.com/item=119326, abandon it or don't pick it up unless you want the silver and xp from completing it. Go out to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33726 to get the next quest for the chain.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=13730\nThis a good spot to get the level 19 twink bis, quest drops from the npc patrolling this area you are questing so just loot everything you kill. https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26447 should be in one of them that will lead to https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26449 for level 19 bis. (https://www.wowhead.com/item=24119, https://www.wowhead.com/item=24120, or https://www.wowhead.com/item=24118) easy money.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=26447\nNPC https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33760 located in mines at the rear of splintertree post. stay left at the T.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=13797\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=13805 doesn't need to be done so don't pick It up.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=13798\nA https://www.wowhead.com/spell=63704 is placed on you. You must climb left or right guard towers, https://www.wowhead.com/item=45598 is in your bags click, drop, rinse, and repeat from top of guard towers. next quest is outside at https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33726\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=13841\nPicked up at https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33726, outside mines. Pick up https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13841 and Hearth to org if your hearthstone is set there.  WARNING because https://www.wowhead.com/npc=39605 has been dethroned and is no longer in command, and https://www.wowhead.com/npc=86832 was killed during the battle opening Legion expansion.  https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13841 can now be turned in at the seat of power in the valley of strength. The new warchief has not been awarded the throne as of yet so https://www.wowhead.com/npc=14720 has assumed command and all quest giving potential for the time being.\n\nhttps://www.wowhead.com/quest=13842\nFly back out to Splintertree post, go into the mines and talk with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33760, after confronting him follow him to the rear of the mine, he will change into a demon and attack you, fight and kill him. due to the massive changes to the warchief position your map won't show where to turn it in. the quest ? will be there when you get back to Org and into the throne room.\n\nBOOM! you are the proud owner of https://www.wowhead.com/item=119326, https://www.wowhead.com/item=119327, or https://www.wowhead.com/item=119325.\n\nHappy Hunting",
            date = "2017-01-15T18:46:26-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13618#comments:id=2463584",
        },
