            id = 1859496,
            score = 359,
            author = "burningglove",
            text = "This had a bug when I did it.  I got the reins from Kadrak as instructed, but then couldn't mount Brutusk.  To fix it I dropped the quest and then went straight to Brutusk, mounted easily and completed the quest, no reins needed.",
