        {
            id = 1945525,
            score = 84,
            author = "Urkberserk",
            text = "After you accept the quest and speak to Kadrak (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=34006), you'll receive Kadrak's Reins (http://www.wowhead.com/item=45051), which gives you a buff that will allow you to ride Brutusk (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=62885). The beast, Brutusk (http://wowhead.com/npc=33374), stands a few yards away waiting for you to jump aboard, but if the quest is bugged you can't mount. If that happens, simply /reload your UI.",
