        {
            id = 1245560,
            score = 21,
            author = "Duendelstein",
            text = "Thank you, .\n\nWith the moonstones of Ordil'Aran deactivated, we should not need to worry about any further incursions of furbolg here.\n\nHowever, my scouts have returned with disturbing news from the furbolg village. There is an imminent danger massing there.\n\nI wonder, might I entice you to carry a warning to Astranaar for me?\n\nIs there ever a follow up to carry a warning to Astranaar?  Haven't seen one yet...",
