    [13712] = {
        {
            id = 1595085,
            score = 79,
            author = "skarpethinn",
            text = "UPDATE & SUMMARY (as of 4.3.0):\n\nFor everyone having issues with the Kodo stopping at the first group of mobs & hanging there.\n\n-despite AngryLittleBunny's post, there is no Kadrak in Splintertree until AFTER you complete the quest, & he will accept the quest hand-in fine.\n\nHowever, as for actually getting there:\n\nAlmost nothng in this thread worked, & what did work was very specific:\n\n-you can't hearth off the kodo, as you get an on-screen message saying \"You can't do that right now\";\n-ditto for the 'Character Stuck?' option mentioned by Taake;\n-you can't, as Arearda mentioned, simply take the quest then \"follow along\" with the Kodo or make your own way to Splintertree;\n-logging out and logging back in will not fix the problem alone.\n\nHere is how it worked for me:\n\n-take and begin the quest;\n-get stuck;\n-DO NOT ABANDON THE QUEST (nothing else here will work if you simply start all over again);\n-exit the game entirely (ie, don't simply log to Character Select);\n-log back in; you will be at the place the kodo got stuck, but you will not be mounted;\n-hearth out of the zone (if you are bound in Ashenvale, this will not work - change your hearth point & try again);\n-if you have a Haunted Memento (http://www.wowhead.com/item=40110), bank it for the time-being;\n-remove any gear (including weapons - you will not need them on this quest anyway) that has animated visual effects (putting them in your bags will be fine);\n-fly back to the Mor'shan Rampart, but make sure you dismount a fair way out, and run in on foot;\n-talk to Kadrak again (you should still have the quest from before) to remount, and voila! the quest should complete fine this time.",
            date = "2011-12-12T16:54:55-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13712#comments:id=1595085",
        },
        {
            id = 1520422,
            score = 76,
            author = "242968",
            text = "Kadrak is a lot more upset when the kodo dies at the end of this quest than he was when Gorka died at the end of the last one.\n\nWhen Gorka dies: \"Gorka... We must always be prepared for losses. Her honorable service to the Horde will not be forgotten.\"\n\nWhen the kodo dies: \"BRUTUSK! NOOOOOOO!\"",
            date = "2011-09-17T23:07:31-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13712#comments:id=1520422",
        },
        {
            id = 1861094,
            score = 63,
            author = "MickMaster01",
            text = "The quest is still bugged, however, Blizzard has added a new option: \"This seems urgent, Kadrak. There must be another way!\", which puts you on a wind rider to Splintertree Post instead.",
            date = "2013-06-01T01:44:44-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13712#comments:id=1861094",
        },
        {
            id = 1657688,
            score = 60,
            author = "865160",
            text = "If anyone can offer support on how to get Brutusk to return from \"Watering the bushes\" that'd be great.",
            date = "2012-04-23T07:13:08-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13712#comments:id=1657688",
        },
        {
            id = 1656499,
