            author = "Nathadan",
            text = "I cannot believe this hasn't made it onto here yet.  If you log into an alliance toon and kill Kadrak (northern barrens version) and his kodo and then attempt to start with his respawned version works like a charm.  A 58 Alliance DK was all it took.  Good luck guys!\n\n Also Kodo went non-stop no hold ups, no bug outs, fought every fight without stalling or needing restarts etc.",
            date = "2012-04-20T11:55:05-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13712#comments:id=1656499",
        },
    },
