            text = "I had trouble finding the location of this quest; here's some help. There's a three-way meeting of roads at 74.6, 76.4. Take the road running east-northeast, you'll find the mine almost immediately. (Mine entrance coordinates are 75.8, 75.4.) As mentioned above, from that point forward you have to follow the little red dots on the floor. You'll go deep into the mine until you find a circular room with a giant floating spore in it; use the given item on the spore, boom, done.",
