    [13842] = {
        {
            id = 1275054,
            score = 132,
            author = "Strudels",
            text = "So...\n\nJust sayin', really awkward doing this quest chain as a Warlock.\n\n\"The demons want nothing more than for us to become reliant on their foul magics.\" -- Well, crap.\n\n\"And I smell its [a demon's] taint on you as well, ....\" -- Well, there's one right next to me.\n\n\"Listen... Before you say anything, I KNOW we're not to meddle with demonic energies....\" -- Oops.\n\n\"There is strong prejudice against the use of demonic magics. Unjustified, but real nonetheless. For this reason, I will transform you into an imp for the duration of the mission to prevent you from being identified.\" -- Hey! I can be the same as my pet now!\n\n\"Did you feel it, !\n\nThe raw fel power seething through your being?\" -- Well, I figure, since I cast that kind of thing all the time...\n\nJust try not to chuckle when you're doing this chain on a lock.",
            date = "2011-01-03T11:46:39-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13842#comments:id=1275054",
        },
        {
            id = 1473607,
            score = 97,
            author = "Cierona",
            text = "Direct chain of quests to this one:\n\nFind Gorat! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13618)\nFinal Report (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13619)\nTo Dinah, at Once! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13620)\nGorat's Vengeance (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13621)\nGot Wood? (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13628) (Remember to talk to Kadrak after getting the quest from Truun)\nManagement Material (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13640) (Look out for the level 24 stealthed spiders)\nNeeds a Little Lubrication (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13651)\nCrisis at Splintertree (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13653)\nTo the Rescue! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13712)\nBlood of the Weak (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13803) (You only need to hand it in to Durak to unlock the next step.  You don't need to accept Pierce Their Heart! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13805). Look for the '!' over the demolisher/catapult when you get back outside)\nPlaying With Felfire (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13730)*\nTell No One! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13751)\nDirty Deeds (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13797)\nRain of Destruction (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13798) (also rewards blue items.  Again ignore the quest Durak is offering when you turn it in, and head outside to Draaka.)\nAll Apologies (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13841)\nDread Head Redemption (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13842)\n\n*If you're doing this chain for twink gear, then make sure to pick up Diabolical Plans (http://www.wowhead.com/item=23797), which drops from the mobs in the same area as the felfire.  The next quest in that chain, Never Again! (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26449), rewards BiS rings for most classes @19/20.  The best time to do that quest is just after you've picked up All Apologies (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13841) (so you can hearthstone to Orgrimmar once you've got the 2 weapons, talk to Hellscream, then fly back to get Durak's head).\n\nAlso, you may as well pick up Destroy the Legion (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=26448) from Valusha at the same time as Playing With Felfire (http://www.wowhead.com/quest=13730), for a bit more gold, as you'll be killing the demons anyway.",
            date = "2011-07-18T19:33:56-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13842#comments:id=1473607",
        },
        {
            id = 2021314,
            score = 74,
            author = "EvilKender",
            text = "As of patch 6.0.2 it looks like the tracking on this quest has a minor bug. The standard map pins to show both the location of Durak to \"persuade\" him and the turn-in do not show up on the map or mini-map. Showing Durak's location (in the mine, if you need the reminder) isn't a big deal, but the quest text doesn't specify to return to Vol'jin for turn-in. Since there's no stated destination, and no map pin for where to turn in the quest, it could get a bit confusing for newer folks.\n\nSo, moral of the story:\n\nVol'jin (Org) --> Durak (Splintertree) --> Vol'jin --> Profit.\n\nEdit: Sorry, looks like Vigg already posted a note on this.",
            date = "2014-10-30T23:57:47-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13842#comments:id=2021314",
        },
        {
            id = 1204420,
            score = 60,
            author = "336987",
            text = "I think you're all concentrating on the wrong part of the quest here... Garrosh had a BOUNTY ON YOUR HEAD.\n\nNow, I know what you're thinking: \"holy crap, he was going to have me killed!\" That is true, but the important part is this... what was the quest reward? Was it a blue or a crappy green? Was it a group quest? Tell me Garrosh, how many people did you have to contract?",
            date = "2010-12-03T14:55:44-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13842#comments:id=1204420",
        },
        {
            id = 1187168,
            score = 53,
            author = "karijne",
            text = "If Hellscream is so mad at this orc using demon magic to save a Horde outpost, imagine how he'll react when he realises that orcs use are using it every day (http://www.wowhead.com/class=9) to kill boars in Durotar.",
            date = "2010-11-26T08:50:16-06:00",
