    [13870] = {
        {
            id = 1076512,
            score = 8,
            author = "447186",
            text = "Overseer Gorthak is located inside Kargathia Keep (90,58) in the Warsong Lumber Camp. Leads to \"Security (http://cata.wowhead.com/quest=13871)!\".\n\nLance\nBeta tester for;\nWrath of the Litch King\nCataclysm",
            date = "2010-07-09T04:09:36-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13870#comments:id=1076512",
        },
        {
            id = 2566795,
            score = 4,
            author = "dillybar",
            text = "In order to complete https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=4976, my last questline was \"The Diplomat From Silvermoon\".  This is supposed to start with https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13873, but in order to receive that quest, you must first complete https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13871.\n\nOh, but to get \"Security\", you first need to do https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13870.  This quest is given out by https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33889 at (82,53) in Satyrnaar, Ashenvale.\n\nIn order to find Krokk, you need to toss https://www.wowhead.com/item=45710 into the smoldering brazier at that location.  Problem was, I no longer had the powder.  Not sure where I used it, or if I discarded it, or what happened, I don't remember.\n\nYou are supposed to be able to talk to https://www.wowhead.com/npc=33837 to get more, but all he did was said \"Blood and Thunder\" to me in his dialogue box.  I tried logging out, logging in the next day, reloading, going back to where Krokk was supposed to be, etc.  Nothing worked.\n\nI finally opened a ticket, and within 24 hours, a GM had sent me a bag of powder, along with this message:\n\nNot to worry, we have seen this pop up a few times, and I can confirm that our devs are aware of the issue.  They have allowed us to send out the powder to players who are stuck.  You will find the Secret Signal Powder in your mailbox shortly.\n\nI don't know if anyone else has had this issue, but I was really frustrated because there was no info on any of these quests related to the problems I was having.  Hopefully, if you have had these issues, this will help you.",
            date = "2018-05-10T16:33:29-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13870#comments:id=2566795",
        },
    },
    [13871] = {
        {
            id = 1194702,
            score = 283,
            author = "Dusktide",
            text = "ok so i spent way too long trying to do this stupid quest.\n\nPRO TIP: ignore the emotes and keep running circles (in front of keep and inside it) until the assassin attacks you. I wasted so much time looking in a small circle for the assassin after I read things like \"you think you see a shadowy figure out of the corner of your eye\". dont look for her, she'll find you.\n\nkeep. moving.\n\ngood luck",
