        },
        {
            id = 2552697,
            score = 8,
            author = "Wowzir",
            text = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13874 and https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13876\n\nNote: pick up https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13876 quest from https://www.wowhead.com/npc=34251 before entering the cave.\n\n/way Ashenvale 38.5, 36.2 Thistlefur Village ENTR\n/way Ashenvale 37.4, 32.5 Path - Thistlefur Hold\n/way Ashenvale 38.0, 30.1 Available Quest?\n/way Ashenvale 38.2, 30.6 Cave ENTR\n/cway\n............................................................................\n\nChest Waypoints inside the cave:\n\nWARNING:  Chest A is located on the lower level near the water and is behind a pillar.\nThis is in the same area where you will find https://www.wowhead.com/npc=3987 for the optional quest https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13876.\n\n/way Ashenvale 41.6, 35.7 Dal Bloodclaw\n/way Ashenvale 41.5, 34.8 Chest A\n/way Ashenvale 40.5, 34.4 Chest B\n/way Ashenvale 40.0, 33.1 Chest C\n/way Ashenvale 40.0, 32.4 Chest D\n/way Ashenvale 39.9, 34.2 Chest E\n/way Ashenvale 39.7, 32.9 Chest F\n/way Ashenvale 39.4, 33.5 Chest G\n/cway\n............................................................................\n\nHelpful Hint:  If you get killed (agggaaiiiiinnnn!) in the cave and wind up in the graveyard in Astranaar,\nbe sure to travel WEST (over the bridge) out of Astranaar to the main road and then head NORTH to\nyour rotten, slimy, mouldering CORPSE\n\n;)",
            date = "2018-02-14T14:40:26-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13874#comments:id=2552697",
        },
        {
            id = 1703595,
            score = 3,
            author = "1020729",
            text = "I was looking for larger, really green chests..That is not the case, but luckily it didn't take me that long to learn.. Some were kinda brown from the lighting, go me...\n\nAnd am I the only one who thinks the Thistlefurs are freakin adorable just sitting there being all fat? I wanna hug one",
            date = "2012-08-23T20:58:21-05:00",
