        {
            id = 1224834,
            score = 50,
            author = "Laitarne",
            text = "I had the same problem, after trying it a couple times I think I narrowed it down to the quest being bugged so that if the periodic damage from Vortex Vengeance kills him you are not properly credited for the kill.\n\nMy final time, I slowly worked him to death with Sky Lightning after weakening him enough with Vortex Vengeance and was properly credited.",
