        },
        {
            id = 1507176,
            score = 3,
            author = "448060",
            text = "This must be the finest, most touching quest line in Wow.\n\nNo it's not! We are doing something evil here! The questgiver (Pelturas Whitemoon (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=3894)) is a monster! I wish he was flagged differently so I could beat him up.\n\nHe's been trying to \"cure\" Relara (http://www.wowhead.com/npc=3892) since before Cata. There's even a comic about (http://www.darklegacycomics.com/231.html) it. Really what's he's doing is poisoning his daughter to make her sick. Remember the movie Six Sense where the mother was putting drain cleaner into her food? That's what you are helping him do by doing this questline.\n\nIn the Münchausen by Proxy syndrome (http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/M%C3%BCnchausen_syndrome_by_proxy), an adult care-giver makes a child sick by either fabricating symptoms or actually causing harm to the child whereby convincing not only the child but others, including medical providers, that their child is sick.\n\nThis info used to be in the notes of the old pre-Cata questline, but I can't find it.",
            date = "2011-08-31T01:02:59-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13924#comments:id=1507176",
        },
