        {
            id = 1268348,
            score = 17,
            author = "corvis9",
            text = "The respawn rate on the furblogs is way too low given how few there are. 15min of waiting, still no love.\n\nThe foulweald corpses just north of silverwind are scenery masquerading as mobs, they will never respawn. Head east of them for the actual mobs. The in game quest helper is a little inaccurate in its placing of the blue area markers sometimes.",
            date = "2010-12-30T17:11:05-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13967#comments:id=1268348",
        },
        {
            id = 1259662,
            score = 5,
            author = "540613",
            text = "Frustrating quest to say the least.\n\n- The 'rare' spawn, Oakpaw, does not drop ears.\n\n- There is a 100% droprate of only 1 ear per mob.\n\n- You can't have more than 10 ears so you will need 2 bagspace for this quest.",
