            score = 3,
            author = "Boomerasp",
            text = "You won't like this one!  Cleared the fire shrine ok, but went to Big Baobob only to find him under attack by about 50 Demonic invaders.  No\nway I could handle that alone, so I guess I'll have to abandon the quest.  Hate that after doing all the work!\n\nOK -- found the solution 2 hours later.  When you're ready to turn in quest to Big Baobob, run through crowd of attackers and stand right between his legs.  Click on him and turn in quest -- you won't take any damage.  He'll give you new quest to kill 30 attackers.  Don't move, accept quest, and pick off attackers one at a time from between his legs.  Attackers are weak and die easily, just take your time -- you don't take much damage, and the reward is worth the effort.  NOTE:  If you're a hunter like I was, set pet for \"Passive\" before running in -- other-wise you'll lose him.   LUCK!",
            date = "2010-12-17T19:59:15-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13985#comments:id=1241536",
        },
    },
    [13987] = {
        {
            id = 2546774,
            score = 16,
            author = "Phaldor8",
            text = "So, In tracking down the problem with the Stardust Spire sub-achievement, I ran into a broken questline.  I thought all I had to do was finish \"Check in on the Edunes\" because that was a precursor listed for \"Three Friends of the Forest\", but running the questline stated to get that quest did not open it for me.  On that note, it did lead me to a quest that put me at the location of the same name as the sub-achievement, so here is the questline that I believe is at least a part of the requirements for Stardust Spire:\n\nBathran's Hair\nDelivery for Orendil\nBathed In Light\nOrendil's Cure\nElune's Tear\n\nFollowed by:[br]\n\nDryad Delivery\nSearch the Bole\nPlaying Possum\n\nThat unlocks:\n\nTo the Spire\n\nThe only quest at Stardust Spire that I didn't attribute to another previously known questline was \"Retaking Mystral Lake\" which upon completion still didn't give me the sub-achievement.  Finally, after completing \"The Goblin Braintrust\" it dinged the sub-achievement.\n\nAt this point, I have no idea whether the following quests are a part of this line or not, even though they seem to be currently linked to this sub-achievement, and I have completed them, I don't think they are:\n\nThree Friends of the Forest\nIn a Bind\nClear the Shrine\nThe Last Stand",
            date = "2018-01-18T15:25:07-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13987#comments:id=2546774",
        },
        {
            id = 1199283,
            score = 15,
            author = "RenK",
            text = "Watch were you throw your aoe spells. Don't be like me and suddenly find you now have half the group+ coming after you... my poor lvl. 29 mage didn't last long.",
            date = "2010-12-01T02:48:24-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13987#comments:id=1199283",
        },
        {
            id = 1318600,
            score = 7,
            author = "430286",
            text = "Stay near Big Baobob and they won't attack you until you attack them. Then its easy to pick one off at a time. After you kill one you are no longer in battle so you can take a break and bandage yourself or drink some water if your out of mana.\nIts a bit boring, but at least its easy.",
            date = "2011-02-01T20:09:18-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13987#comments:id=1318600",
        },
        {
            id = 1198190,
            score = 4,
            author = "Koper",
            text = "This quest doesn't make any sense at all, unless I'm missing something. Do I have to kill 30 mobs without any sort of \"help\" from a special mob/item? Where is the challenge in that? It's just boring :S",
            date = "2010-11-30T15:22:19-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13987#comments:id=1198190",
        },
        {
            id = 1317130,
            score = 3,
            author = "Moriath",
            text = "I stood between Baobob's legs, and was barely touched, at level 24, I think. Druid class. ALWAYS stay near your tank (in this case, him)! I used the hotkey to target next opponent, and simply used my own healing instants intermingled with my casting to destroy the demons very quickly. This mission really got my adrenaline going! I was certain it would kill me off! Anyway, I hope this helps some!",
            date = "2011-01-31T14:29:40-06:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13987#comments:id=1317130",
