        {
            id = 3143372,
            score = 12,
            author = "TheSkullpitter",
            text = "This quest is a fantastic exercise in psychological horror. After you place the banner, Phase One begins. In Phase One every furbolg that currently exists in the entire world will attack you, one by one, over the course of seventeen years. Once that's done, in Phase Two, every furbolg that has ever existed shows up, still in single-file, and you have to kill them too. Then there's more furbolgs. Once you start wondering if you've ever been doing anything but fighting furbolgs on this hill, Phase Three begins: the chief shows up and you can kill him, and then you can \"leave.\" But a part of you will always still be on that hill, fighting furbolgs, all the furbolgs, all the time, forever. Enjoy Phase Four!",
