        {
            id = 1729240,
            score = 4,
            author = "Divo91",
            text = "Confirmed- Quest is doable on MoP.\n\nI got mine plans dropped off the lady demons on the second try (ONLY AFTER ACTIVATING THE LOW LEVEL QUESTS TRACKING! Before that I probably killed around ~40 demons and it didn't drop.)",
            date = "2012-10-02T22:11:51-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26447#comments:id=1729240",
        },
        {
            id = 1712173,
            score = 2,
            author = "1030102",
            text = "i did this quest with 2 twinks (1 horde and 1 alliance) 2 days before 5.0 went live and got the quest item from the first infernal i killed. since the patch ive tried it with 2 other horde toons and killed about 50 infernals with each of them (a goblin rogue and BE pally) to no avail.\n\nthese are 3 GREAT rings for twinks... are they alliance only now as well or is it a glitch?\nwhy does alliance have at least 1 better BiS item than horde does, for each class?\n\nIf this is not a glitch and was removed intentionally, from horde side only (last i heard it still drops for alliance), where can i find information on it when it happens? i read the patch notes and didnt see anything about removing quests.",
            date = "2012-09-11T08:19:15-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26447#comments:id=1712173",
        },
        {
            id = 1713779,
            score = 2,
            author = "Arkath187",
            text = "\"I’ve gotten your ticket regarding finding some information about the Diabolical Plans item. As the information you are requesting may be considered a game hint, I’m afraid I won’t be able to go into much detail regarding this, but I’ll provide you what information I can!\n\nThe item does indeed still drop, though the drop rate is rather low, so it could potentially take dozens, if not hundreds, of kills in order to see it drop.\"\n\nThis is directly from a customer support memeber after I had recently opened a ticket about the Diabolical Plans not dropping. I had read that this quest was no longer obtainable and a few players were telling me that they had looted the item earlier in the day. It seems as of patch 5.0 the droprate has drastically went down. So for those of us who are looking to get the twink ring, good luck and happy farming those demons! lol",
            date = "2012-09-14T23:19:39-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26447#comments:id=1713779",
        },
    },
