        {
            id = 1822184,
            score = 0,
            author = "silvershadows",
            text = "Went to do this quest today, 3/6/13, just after patch 5.2 went live.\n\nKilled fifty tendrils+ (didn't start counting until around 10-15 kills and then counted up to 50) with no gem drop, so I abandoned the quest and re-acquired it immediately.  Seventy more tendril kills later, and the gem still has not dropped.\n\nNot sure if the patch has bugged the quest or if I'm just extremely unlucky, but in any case, it's definitely frustrating.  The drop rate for the gem is listed at around 25 percent, so not finding it in slightly over 120 kills is a fairly good indication that something is wrong.\n\nJust wanted to let people know, in case someone else tries this quest after this latest patch and has the same issue.  I'm also submitting an in-game ticket.\n\nEdit:  Just spoke to a GM and confirmed that this quest (as well as a few others) is currently bugged, but it should be hotfixed later today.  Will leave this comment here in case anyone else tries to do it before the hotfix and starts to wonder if they are going crazy.",
