        {
            id = 2587365,
            score = 8,
            author = "neurocase",
            text = "Currently on 8.0, this and https://www.wowhead.com/quest=13602 are difficult (if not near impossible) to complete, thanks to The Zoram Strand phasing oddly due to its proximity with southern Darkshore. Speaking with https://www.wowhead.com/npc=141489 doesn't currently fix this either, at the moment (2/8/18) as she doesn't appear to be phasing the zone correctly, which is having this ripple effect on the Zoram Strand. I was only able to find 1/10 statuettes within the Ashenvale zone, but the rest are too deep within the Zoram Strand, and it didn't seem to respawn either. Hopefully, this phasing issue (and Zidormi, by extension) will be fixed when the expansion launches fully on the 14th.",
