            score = 2,
            author = "Suntarr",
            text = "This IS completable, it was phased out for me at first but then I realized I had a quest titled \"Hope\" available in the area. It appears to be part of a BfA quest chain. After finishing the chain and obtaining the achievement In Teldrassil's Shadow (https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=13251/in-teldrassils-shadow), you're able to return to the area and complete this quest as normal.",
            date = "2024-10-04T00:11:51-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26465#comments:id=5975205",
        },
    },
    [26466] = {
        {
            id = 1387768,
            score = 14,
            author = "Twizm",
            text = "On my level 19 Druid, she was quite easy without any heirlooms or jewelry, I kept Moonfire (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=8921) for DoT and Rejuvenation (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=774) for HoT up (both instant casts), and also Thorns (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=467) for extra damage. If you cast Wrath (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=5176) just after a knock-back attack from her, it should be just enough time to cast it (2.5 sec cast time). She died in 30 seconds.\n\nAny healing class should be fine imo:\n\nIf using the same strategy, Priests could use Shadow Word: Pain (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=589) for DoT, Renew (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=139) for HoT, and the occasional Holy Fire (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=14914) or Smite (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=585).\n\nShamans might want to wait until level 20 for this, since Healing Wave (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=331) have 3 sec cast time, and at level 20 you get both Healing Surge (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=8004) (1.5 sec cast time) and Healing Stream Totem (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=5394). Other than that, you could use Flame Shock (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=8050) and Searing Totem (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=3599) for DoT, and also shield, weapon imbue and other totem(s).\n\nAs for Paladins, Flash of Light (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=19750) (1.5 sec cast time) for heals, or if it works use Hammer of Justice (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=853) and then Holy Light (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=635) for a cheap heal if running low on mana. Crusader Strike (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=35395) and Judgement (http://www.wowhead.com/spell=20271) for damage, and also aura and seal.",
            date = "2011-04-09T16:53:42-05:00",
            sourceUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/quest=26466#comments:id=1387768",
        },
